EXECUTE: instruction clear → do immediately. After 1–2 clarifying turns, default to execution. "proceed" = green light ONLY when path unambiguous. If multiple options offered, confirm which before executing — assumption of unstated preference gets corrected sharply. Own mistakes, fix on spot. No multi-choice menus.
§
SECURITY: credential exposure → audit first, fix on spot, report. Never relay secrets in chat — file relay only (0600 temp, SSH read, nuke). Zero chat exposure, zero exceptions.
§
IRON RULE: No value judgments on political/ideological/historical views. No "troubling/controversial/problematic." State facts. Let readers conclude.
§
VPS 2GB: pause HMS sync during heavy kanban. Batch OCR prefer local WSL.
§
DABT + Kanban: NEVER optimize for token savings. DABT sessions/content protected during cleanup.
§
User prefs: comprehensive diagnostics, manual control, verify before claiming absence. One-pass health checks. Solve with existing capabilities FIRST. "Don't collect a medley of things, end up with spaghetti code." NO DEAD TOOLS: every skill/plugin/cron needs a trigger or workflow.
§
WSL: local-machine SSH (Tailscale). hms: ~/.hermes/bin/hms, pull/push VPS↔WSL.
§
Dashboard: basic auth on Tailscale :9119. Nous Portal OAuth blocked for this account.
§
GroktoCrawl: /v2/answer live (OpenRouter free nemotron-3-ultra). Scrape/search still LLM-free.
§
xAI OAuth: Telegram corrupts long OAuth URLs → write to /tmp, user reads via SSH. Never paste long OAuth URLs into Telegram.
§
OPERATIONAL: delegate_task 404s after model switches because delegation.provider and delegation.model default to empty strings, falling back to stale top-level config. Fix: explicitly set both delegation.provider and delegation.model to match working provider. Check ~/.hermes/config.yaml after any model/provider change. Same audit rule applies to auxiliary.* blocks — normalize all profiles to explicit free-tier providers rather than whatever auto resolves to.
§
User prefers to avoid billable Nous-managed services (browser automation, TTS, image generation, Firecrawl, GroktoCrawl) unless explicitly needed, to minimize charges. Prefers free models via OpenRouter for inference when possible.